native_cpp/src/* is a verbatim copy of files from
https://github.com/luanlouzada/rinha_backend2026 (MIT-licensed).

The upstream sources are:
  - src/server.cpp
  - src/build_index.cpp
  - src/index.hpp
  - src/fd_lb.c

These are vendored unmodified to make it cheap to reproduce the reference
top1 setup as an alternative API/LB build (see deploy/Dockerfile.native).
